┌ Help ─ main view ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Everything flk runs on this host. Left: apps, with their machines (●         │
│ running, ○ stopped, ! should run but doesn't), volumes (▢) and forwarded     │
│ ports (⇄), then the host. Right: tabs for the selection. Bottom: what needs  │
│ attention, from flk context --all. Below Host: Storage, Podman and Services, │
│ the rest of what this host runs. What's healthy folds (▸) to one line, and   │
│ opens (▾) by itself when something there goes wrong. Apps you stopped come   │
│ last, folded, and are one line at the bottom, not problems. Each tab shows   │
│ the command that fills it, and every action shows the command it runs before │
│ running it (L lists them all). Changes show as they happen (flk events       │
│ --follow); the Events tabs list them.                                        │
│                                                                              │
│ ↑ ↓  k j           move in the tree                                          │
│ ← →                fold or unfold an app or a section (enter opens a sectio… │
│ tab  shift+tab     next or previous tab                                      │
│ 1 … 9              jump to a tab                                             │
│ pgup pgdn          scroll the tab (also ctrl+u ctrl+d)                       │
│ l                  follow logs: the machine, or all of the app's machines    │
│ enter  x           actions for the selection (start, stop, deploy, secrets,… │
│ s                  start or stop the selected machine, or all of an app's    │
│ … 12 more (↓)                                                                │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
